      "value" : "<center style=\"font-size: 17px;\">THE BHARATIYA NAGARIK SURAKSHA SANHITA, 2023</center> <center style=\"font-size: 17px;\">ACT NO. 46 OF 2023</center> <p style=\"text-align:right;\">[<i>25th December, 2023.</i>]</p> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>An Act to consolidate and amend the law relating to Criminal Procedure.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/> <span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>BE it enacted by Parliament in the Seventy-fourth Year of the Republic of India as follows:---<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
